From f876f7b1662bee6a2e74030014ff30ca72675d79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chenyk <chenyk@gl-inet.com>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 14:15:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 102/103] perf: N-work pool parallel decrypt and encrypt

Implement per-peer decrypt_queue + decrypt_ctx[4] work pool for parallel
decryption on WQ_UNBOUND workqueue. RX path (ovpn_recv) enqueues skb and
round-robin schedules workers. Workers dequeue and decrypt in parallel.

For TX, UDP uses encrypt_queue + encrypt_ctx[4] for parallel encryption.
TCP uses synchronous encryption due to socket lock constraints.

Add local_bh_disable/enable around gro_cells_receive to prevent
NOHZ local_softirq_pending warnings from workqueue context.

Defer ovpn_peer_put in workers to after loop completion to prevent
deadlock with cancel_work_sync in peer release path.

Signed-off-by: chenyk <chenyk@gl-inet.com>
---
